      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹13.21 (up from ₹6.10 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹5.21b (up 235% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹538.6m (up 119% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 10% (down from 16% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 71% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 150% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
